{"4944760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Regalia", "steam_appid": 4944760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Regalia is an 8-Bit-inspired twin-stick horde survivor where every run is remembered differently.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander into the Mist, find a realm buried by forgetting. Oxygen is your clock and your lifeline — once it runs out, all it takes is one hit, to wake you out of Nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Regalia are Weapons and Partners. Memories of those who were. Fight alongside them, level up, and strengthen the Bonds to become stronger together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories twist and turn, shifting each run — turning every failure into inheritance for the runs that follow. TLDR:  YOUR DECISIONS MATTER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece the map back together, memory by memory, and chase Masteries that unlock new wielders, new Regalia, new ways to Play and new truths about the world you're trying to recall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A bullet-heaven roguelite about time, memory, and what's worth remembering.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Details</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a number soup. Upgrades do more than shift numbers around, craft your strategies around changing weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTROLLED chaos. Precise positioning and dodging will win you more games than luck. (Luck helps too.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Hybrid Upgrade System  there's no stopping in the middle of the action. Get upgrades dynamically in the middle of combat, and choose what to keep or new options at the end of each encounter. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realm Map</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the encounters by forging your path on a changing map. Level grind in the early areas of the map or venture deeper for higher risk and rewards. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4944760/extras/79b6248ace2287360001d671f3b5cab0.poster.avif?t=1787025637\" aria-label=\"Hero traverses the map and selects a tile to Encounter.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4944760/extras/79b6248ace2287360001d671f3b5cab0.webm?t=1787025637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4944760/extras/79b6248ace2287360001d671f3b5cab0.mp4?t=1787025637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in encounters and mow down enemies as you explore areas with varying objectives and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4944760/extras/f4bf2313227191013e04574370ad4ac9.poster.avif?t=1787025637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4944760/extras/f4bf2313227191013e04574370ad4ac9.webm?t=1787025637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4944760/extras/f4bf2313227191013e04574370ad4ac9.mp4?t=1787025637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Masteries, Get Rewarded</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masteries are challenges to strive for and each one unlocks something new. It could be upgrades, new Regalia for the pool, game mechanics, characters and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression doesn't just open up the world,